# Game completion / final screen animation, ported from f_finale.c to Flow.
#
# Public ABI (f_finale.h): F_StartFinale, F_Responder, F_Ticker, F_Drawer.
# Cast helpers and drawers stay module-private. Finale-owned globals,
# textscreen/cast tables, and cast sfx picker live here. Long text blobs
# live in this module (@flow_api finaledata_*).

